     ('the suffix beginning at the least index where a predicate fails', '(define (first-failure-index p l)\n  (let loop ((i 0) (rest l))\n    (cond ((null? rest) i)\n          ((p (car rest)) (loop (+ i 1) (cdr rest)))\n          (else i))))\n(define l (list 1 3 4 5))\n(display (equal? (drop l (first-failure-index odd? l)) (drop-while odd? l)))\n(newline)'),
