     ('the length-1 suffix of a sequence', '(define (suffix1 l) (take-right l 1))\n(display (list (suffix1 (list 1 2 3)) (equal? (suffix1 (list 1 2 3)) (last-pair (list 1 2 3)))))\n(newline)'),
